","E44","E46","E48","E51"],"verdict":"explanation fits the numbers"}},{"attrs":{"caseId":"40704_2019-05-26","revisionId":"95a949a0c7cb","sampleIndex":1,"findingIndex":0,"management_says":"Revenue growth of 7% primarily reflects the addition of Blue Buffalo; organic net sales were flat (E32, E33, E34, E35).","numbers_show":"Pet segment (Blue Buffalo) recorded $1,431M net sales in FY2019 (E51) vs $0 in FY2018 (E33, E50). Total revenue rose $1,125M (E1, E12). Other segments declined: North America Retail -2% (E41), Europe & Australia -5% (E46), Convenience Stores & Foodservice +2% (E44), Asia & Latin America -3% (E48). The acquisition more than accounts for the total growth, with organic segments offsetting.","fit":"fits","evidence":["E1","E12","E32","E33","E34","E35","E41","E44","E46","E48","E50","E51"],"verdict":"explanation fits the numbers"}},{"attrs":{"caseId":"40704_2019-05-26","revisionId":"95a949a0c7cb","sampleIndex":2,"findingIndex":0,"management_says":"Consolidated net sales rose 7% to $16.9B, primarily reflecting the addition of Blue Buffalo; organic net sales were essentially flat (E32, E33, E34).","numbers_show":"Pet segment (Blue Buffalo) contributed $1,431M of net sales in FY2019 (E51) vs $0 in FY2018 (one-month lag, E50). Total revenue grew $1,124.8M (E1, E12). Other segments declined: North America Retail -2% (E41), Europe & Australia -5% (E46), Convenience Stores & Foodservice +2% (E44), Asia & Latin America -3% (E48). Organic net sales flat per management (E35) matches segment organic trends (E42, E47, E49).","fit":"fits","evidence":["E1","E12","E32","E33","E34","E35","E41","E42","E44","E46","E47","E48","E49","E50","E51"],"verdict":"explanation partially fits the numbers"}}],"rulings":[{"attrs":{"caseId":"40704_2019-05-26","revisionId":"95a949a0c7cb","sampleIndex":0,"rulingIndex":0,"finding_index":0,"ruling":"fits","reason":"Consolidated revenue grew 7.1% (E1, E12). The new Pet segment contributed $1.431B in net sales (E51), while other segments declined: North America Retail -2% (E41), Convenience Stores & Foodservice +2% (E44), Europe & Australia -5% (E46), Asia & Latin America -3% (E48). Management states organic net sales were flat (E35). The acquisition is visible in segment data and its size accounts for the overall growth.","evidence":["E1","E12","E51","E41","E44","E46","E48","E35"],"rebuttal":{"finding_index":0,"innocent_explanation":"The 7% revenue growth is fully accounted for by the Blue Buffalo acquisition, which added a new Pet segment with $1.431B in net sales in FY2019, while organic sales were flat as other segments declined.","evidence":["E1","E12","E32","E33","E34","E35","E41","E44","E46","E48","E51"],"support":"numbers"},"final_verdict":"explanation unverified","confidence":0.8}},{"attrs":{"caseId":"40704_2019-05-26","revisionId":"95a949a0c7cb","sampleIndex":1,"rulingIndex":0,"finding_index":0,"ruling":"fits","reason":"Pet segment net sales of $1,431M in FY2019 (E51) versus $0 in FY2018 (E33, E50) accounts for the $1,125M total revenue increase (E1, E12), while legacy segment declines (E41, E44, E46, E48) offset the remainder, corroborating management's claim that organic net sales were flat (E32, E33, E34, E35).","evidence":["E1","E12","E32","E33","E34","E35","E41","E44","E46","E48","E50","E51"],"rebuttal":{"finding_index":0,"innocent_explanation":"The 7% consolidated revenue growth is fully accounted for by the Blue Buffalo acquisition, which contributed $1,431M of Pet segment net sales in FY2019 (E51) versus zero in FY2018 (E33, E50), while legacy segments collectively declined, resulting in flat organic net sales as management states (E32, E33, E34, E35).","evidence":["E1","E12","E32","E33","E34","E35","E41","E44","E46","E48","E50","E51"],"support":"numbers"},"final_verdict":"explanation fits the numbers","confidence":0.95}},{"attrs":{"caseId":"40704_2019-05-26","revisionId":"95a949a0c7cb","sampleIndex":2,"rulingIndex":0,"finding_index":0,"ruling":"fits","reason":"The 7% revenue growth is fully accounted for by the Blue Buffalo acquisition ($1,431M in FY2019 vs $0 in FY2018 due to one-month lag) while organic net sales were flat across other segments, matching management's description. Segment sales trends (North America Retail -2%, Europe & Australia -5%, Convenience Stores & Foodservice +2%, Asia & Latin America -3%) and organic trends corroborate the flat organic claim.","evidence":["E1","E12","E51","E50","E41","E44","E46","E48","E42","E47","E49","E35"],"rebuttal":{"finding_index":0,"innocent_explanation":"The 7% consolidated revenue growth is fully accounted for by the Blue Buffalo acquisition, which contributed $1,431M of net sales in FY2019 (E51) versus $0 in FY2018 due to the one-month reporting lag (E50), while organic net sales were flat across all other segments (North America Retail -2% per E41, Europe & Australia -5% per E46, Convenience Stores & Foodservice +2% per E44, Asia & Latin America -3% per E48), matching management's organic flatness claim (E35, E42, E47, E49).","evidence":["E1","E12","E51","E50","E41","E44","E46","E48","E42","E47","E49","E35"],"support":"numbers"},"final_verdict":"explanation unverified","confidence":0.78}}],"audit":[{"seq":1,"actor":"evidence-pack","summary":"evidence:ingest:40704_2019-05-26:95a949a0c7cb:E1 (evidence)","kind":"upsertEntity"},{"seq":10,"actor":"evidence-pack","summary":"evidence:ingest:40704_2019-05-26:95a949a0c7cb:E10 (evidence)","kind":"upsertEntity"},{"seq":11,"actor":"evidence-pack","summary":"evidence:ingest:40704_2019-05-26:95a949a0c7cb:E11 (evidence)","kind":"upsertEntity"},{"seq":12,"actor":"evidence-pack","summary":"evidence:ingest:40704_2019-05-26:95a949a0c7cb:E12 (evidence)","kind":"upsertEntity"},{"seq":13,"actor":"evidence-pack","summary":"evidence:ingest:40704_2019-05-26:95a949a0c7cb:E13 (evidence)","kind":"upsertEntity"},{"seq":14,"actor":"evidence-pack","summary":"evidence:ingest:40704_2019-05-26:95a949a0c7cb:E14 (evidence)","kind":"upsertEntity"},{"seq":15,"actor":"evidence-pa